[00:00] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Last December, we introduced GWM Worlds, a world model for real-time environment simulation. It held a space together across long sequences of movement, which was the hard part. Today, we\'re sharing a look'

[00:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'at GWM Worlds 2. Video and audio generation turned into simulation that you play in real time. Rich controls need a way to describe a'

[00:24] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'world, and ours starts from a split. what persists and what changes. We call this world prompt. The persistent half is the scene, the subjects that can act'

[00:36] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'and the laws they follow. The first frame grounds it and from there the world is already moving. The other half is an event stream. Timestamp text actions addressed to a subject or to the'

[00:48] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'scene free to overlay. &gt;&gt; Thank you so much. Have a great day. Camera motion comes as its own input per frame and continuous. To achieve all of this, we take our foundational audio video model and'

[01:01] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'fine-tune it on the world prompt format and it follows the structure. That model is birectional and too slow to play. So we post train it into an auto reggressive one with no fixed duration. GWM Worlds 2 generates 720p video at 24'

[01:15] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'frames per second and audio at 48 kHz, one step at a time. Everything from here was steered live in one continuous session. Actions you use often bind to'

[01:28] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'keys, so play stays fast. An action doesn\'t have to be aimed at a character. Address the scene and the room floods or a dust storm rolls in. Nothing here is a clip. The world'

[01:41] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'continues from each new input for as long as you keep going. You can also start from video instead of an image and the environment and audio carries across. Agents can take the controls too. Give an agent an objective and it'

[01:54] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'works towards it. Told to reach the red flag and then the blue, it did both on the first try. And in the same session, two different people can hold different roles. With GWM Worlds 2, you don\'t have'

[02:06] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'to write any of the setup. Describe the world in a line and the preset comes back ready to play. GWM Worlds 2. Worlds you build at you play.'
